Date: Wed, 25 Nov 2026 22:29:40 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] containments/desktop: keep the file extension visible in
 elided labels
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Long file names on the desktop were cut at the end, hiding the extension
that tells similar files apart, unlike Dolphin. Now the last line of the
label is shortened before the extension, so it reads like "name….pdf".

BUG: 447623
---
 .../contents/ui/FolderItemDelegate.qml        |  4 +-
 .../desktop/plugins/folder/foldermodel.cpp    | 83 +++++++++++++++++++
 .../desktop/plugins/folder/foldermodel.h      |  2 +
 3 files changed, 87 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/containments/desktop/package/contents/ui/FolderItemDelegate.qml b/containments/desktop/package/contents/ui/FolderItemDelegate.qml
index 2676ceaeec..0a9128880a 100644
--- a/containments/desktop/package/contents/ui/FolderItemDelegate.qml
+++ b/containments/desktop/package/contents/ui/FolderItemDelegate.qml
@@ -165,7 +165,7 @@ Item {
                 id: toolTip
                 anchors.fill: impl

-                active: (Plasmoid.configuration.toolTips || label.truncated)
+                active: (Plasmoid.configuration.toolTips || label.truncated || label.text !== main.displayWrapped)
                         && impl.popupDialog === null
                         && !main.blank
                 interactive: false
@@ -366,7 +366,7 @@ Item {
                     renderShadow: main.isOnRootView && !renaming
                     opacity: main.isHidden ? 0.6 : 1

-                    text: main.displayWrapped
+                    text: dir.elideKeepingExtension(positioner.map(main.index), main.displayWrapped, font, width - leftPadding - rightPadding, maximumLineCount)
                     font.italic: main.isLink
                     wrapMode: (maximumLineCount === 1) ? Text.NoWrap : Text.Wrap
                     horizontalAlignment: Text.AlignHCenter
